  "aliases": [],
  "type": "person",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-12-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "近，成文于远。\n\n夫察所夜行，周公惭乎景，故君子慎其独也。释近斯"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "物者，难与言化。\n\n昔太公望、周公旦受封而相见，太公问周公曰：“"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-15-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "也。故道可道者，非常道也。\n\n周公事文王也，行无专制，事无由己，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-16-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，而歌《南风》之诗，以治天下。周公骰蠕不收于前，钟鼓不解于悬，以"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，可谓养性矣，而未可谓孝子也。周公诛管叔、蔡叔，以平国饵乱，可谓"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 24,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-24-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "蔡叔、管叔辅公子禄父而欲为乱。周公继文王之业，持天子之政，以股肱"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "huainanzi",
    "chapterIndex": 12
  }
}
